--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
CableDyn driver deck -- steep near-taut chain leg, minimal grounded length, static IC
-- Contrast to the shallow catenary: here the 270 m chain barely exceeds the ~262 m chord, so the
-- leg is steep and near-taut with only a short touchdown at the anchor (200 m depth). R4 studless
-- chain 155 mm: volume-equivalent diam 0.2791 m, dry mass 480.93 kg/m, EA 2.058e9 N.
